00:15:36,366 --> 00:15:41,000
Wax ini mudah digunakan, lho.

247
00:15:41,023 --> 00:15:44,489
Bagaimana cara menggunakannya?

248
00:15:44,512 --> 00:15:50,903
Ambil sedikit di tangan, lalu ratakan ke seluruh rambut.

249
00:15:50,927 --> 00:15:55,098
Oh, kelihatannya mudah ya.

250
00:15:55,122 --> 00:16:00,188
Poni di bagian depan cukup diberi sedikit saja di akhir.

251
00:16:00,211 --> 00:16:03,002
Baik.

252
00:16:03,026 --> 00:16:06,393
Besok saya akan coba.

253
00:16:06,416 --> 00:16:11,887
Kalau pakai hair oil juga, rambut jadi lebih indah, lho.

254
00:16:11,911 --> 00:16:15,064
Oh, begitu ya?

255
00:16:15,087 --> 00:16:18,621
Minyak seperti apa yang bagus?

256
00:16:18,644 --> 00:16:23,746
Yang dijual di toko-toko itu bagus, kok.

257
00:16:23,769 --> 00:16:27,545
Kalau begitu, saya beli satu juga.

258
00:16:27,568 --> 00:16:30,342
Terima kasih.

259
00:16:30,366 --> 00:16:35,119
Sekarang, lihat bagian belakang lewat cermin ya.

260
00:16:35,142 --> 00:16:37,928
Bagus sekali.

261
00:16:37,952 --> 00:16:40,660
Sempurna!

262
00:16:40,683 --> 00:16:43,550
Syukurlah.

263
00:16:43,573 --> 00:16:46,206
Terima kasih atas kerja kerasnya.

264
00:16:46,229 --> 00:16:49,962
Terima kasih banyak.

265
00:16:49,985 --> 00:16:52,985
Scene 10: Potong Rambut dan Pijat di Salon Kecantikan

266
00:16:52,985 --> 00:16:56,219
Potongannya sudah selesai.

267
00:16:56,242 --> 00:16:59,579
Bagian belakangnya bagaimana?

268
00:16:59,602 --> 00:17:03,584
Tolong tunjukkan lewat cermin.

269
00:17:03,608 --> 00:17:07,204
Silakan.

270
00:17:07,227 --> 00:17:09,927
Seperti ini.

271
00:17:09,950 --> 00:17:13,183
Jadi lebih segar.

272
00:17:13,206 --> 00:17:16,939
Panjangnya pas.

273
00:17:16,962 --> 00:17:19,944
Syukurlah.

274
00:17:19,968 --> 00:17:23,534
Sekarang saya akan memijat bahu Anda.

275
00:17:23,557 --> 00:17:26,424
Silakan.

276
00:17:26,447 --> 00:17:30,204
Ah, di situ.

277
00:17:30,228 --> 00:17:33,328
Sangat enak.

278
00:17:33,351 --> 00:17:37,741
Bahu Anda agak tegang.

279
00:17:37,764 --> 00:17:44,064
Iya, akhir-akhir ini sering pakai komputer.

280
00:17:44,087 --> 00:17:47,038
Pasti lelah ya.

281
00:17:47,062 --> 00:17:51,295
Istirahatlah dengan baik.

282
00:17:51,318 --> 00:17:55,152
Baik, terima kasih banyak.

283
00:17:55,175 --> 00:17:59,369
Sekarang pembayarannya ya.

284
00:17:59,392 --> 00:18:02,359
Silakan ke kasir.

285
00:18:02,382 --> 00:18:05,882
Baik. Berapa harganya?

286
00:18:05,905 --> 00:18:12,300
Potong rambut dan cukur wajah menjadi empat ribu lima ratus yen.

287
00:18:12,323 --> 00:18:16,590
Bisa bayar dengan kartu kredit?

288
00:18:16,613 --> 00:18:20,946
Ya, kartu juga bisa digunakan.

289
00:18:20,969 --> 00:18:26,003
Kalau begitu, saya bayar pakai kartu.

290
00:18:26,026 --> 00:18:28,665
Baiklah.

291
00:18:28,688 --> 00:18:33,054
Silakan masukkan PIN Anda di sini.

292
00:18:33,077 --> 00:18:35,911
Ya.

293
00:18:35,934 --> 00:18:38,846
Terima kasih.

294
00:18:38,869 --> 00:18:43,373
Ini kartu dan struknya.

295
00:18:43,397 --> 00:18:46,332
Terima kasih.

296
00:18:46,356 --> 00:18:51,889
Sebaiknya datang lagi sekitar satu bulan lagi.

297
00:18:51,912 --> 00:18:54,613
Baik.

298
00:18:54,637 --> 00:18:57,273
Saya akan datang lagi.

299
00:18:57,296 --> 00:19:00,363
Terima kasih banyak.

300
00:19:00,386 --> 00:19:03,252
Hati-hati di jalan.

301
00:19:03,275 --> 00:19:06,209
Permisi.